    "b0003-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e54a84e8c7b0b8d90a87c57c2d7857b545c128804144e80178111e61549619a6",
      "targetHash": "e02fc590ea14daa10740caad903bdaf56a79d06554f66817ad62feb063c5e3a3",
      "machineHash": "e02fc590ea14daa10740caad903bdaf56a79d06554f66817ad62feb063c5e3a3",
      "machineText": "坦白说，这是一段漫长的旅程。首个 v3 alpha 标签于 2023 年 1 月发布，从那以后，许多人一路参与构建、测试、发现问题并修复问题。我由衷感谢你们每一个人。如果你想了解这段旅程不加修饰的版本，可以阅读我写的 [v3 beta 发布公告](/blog/wails-v3-beta/)。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "I'll be honest: it has been a long road. The first v3 alpha tag went out in January 2023, and a grea…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0004-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "3f03a093efc83af851370d55be4d5963aff7e8ff0f85d34f35d94b10e4240a92",
      "targetHash": "ca6bc6e11a4c03b3026c6f7bcd41edcad1fdfb742b6201cafbcfae1c8c65f48c",
      "machineHash": "ca6bc6e11a4c03b3026c6f7bcd41edcad1fdfb742b6201cafbcfae1c8c65f48c",
      "machineText": "Wails *是*什么？",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "What *is* Wails?",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0005-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "37e45f8bb6db3867ca7f8edb0a2d5999818e43386d382bab6848fe488361d9db",
      "targetHash": "37a947c9e17a96261629898aa94b641a1eb149cca573fb998695b91f3de71ca3",
      "machineHash": "37a947c9e17a96261629898aa94b641a1eb149cca573fb998695b91f3de71ca3",
      "machineText": "如果你刚接触 Wails：它让 Go 程序员能够使用自己熟悉的 Web 前端工具构建桌面应用，并采用各平台的原生 WebView，而不是嵌入式浏览器。你可以使用 Go 编写后端，使用 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript（或任何你喜欢的框架）编写 UI，再由 Wails 将这一切打包成单个原生应用。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "If you're new here: Wails lets Go programmers build desktop applications with the web frontend tools…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0006-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e52cd01f2c2e579783b55ed8379b76ee9bdfd015b9d9826df689b513c854b882",
      "targetHash": "99247bd04b3da5aea89cd7f6eb679d9fcc74d5d87eac10a8df367ec216dbfc68",
      "machineHash": "99247bd04b3da5aea89cd7f6eb679d9fcc74d5d87eac10a8df367ec216dbfc68",
      "machineText": "为什么推出 v3？",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Why v3?",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0007-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "634b46c2b8b775b659ef1f5d94b105655642736d7605643d5bf16083ad9f70bd",
      "targetHash": "27d628be07cfbb6b65a8538ff32ec2cb4b38cfa419ca9e00b82071482a238d4c",
      "machineHash": "27d628be07cfbb6b65a8538ff32ec2cb4b38cfa419ca9e00b82071482a238d4c",
      "machineText": "Wails v2 让使用现代 Web 前端构建 Go 应用变得简单直接，也一直很好地服务于众多应用。但它的单窗口、上下文驱动运行时，使一些日常桌面开发工作变得比应有的更困难。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Wails v2 made it straightforward to build a Go application with a modern web frontend, and it has se…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0008-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "ed763b4b6065a5e608f90ceb1627996898970e38c8edf9110253fbe69d7a34c9",
      "targetHash": "20c2711bb81d326d8344e2bd69942b6df85f90f51b4c2e132668bbf9c5eedf58",
      "machineHash": "20c2711bb81d326d8344e2bd69942b6df85f90f51b4c2e132668bbf9c5eedf58",
      "machineText": "v3 采用了不同的模型。应用、窗口、服务、事件和平台能力都是显式对象。你可以创建应用、注册服务、创建窗口，并直接与负责所需行为的对象交互。随着应用不断发展，这种模型更容易理解；多窗口等功能也成为模型的常规组成部分，而不再是权宜之计。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "v3 starts from a different model. Applications, windows, services, events and platform capabilities …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0009-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "3e2afbe9fc24233ea3b059cbf6f767a95be786938b0783007af19605b9ba2d98",
      "targetHash": "2f4f82131fd6605473564eb386115efeebe563da0e9d73a97199dd93b2522c54",
      "machineHash": "2f4f82131fd6605473564eb386115efeebe563da0e9d73a97199dd93b2522c54",
      "machineText": "v3.0.0 包含哪些内容",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "What's in v3.0.0",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0010-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "bb3649357791001d71b86e4299ed5acf5f2fc9e5f2db4281eb82ead28b276b2c",
      "targetHash": "84403363a74e6dc4df25bc94ec2ac923d0c28e94b81fa9085e06d56dcfb229c7",
      "machineHash": "84403363a74e6dc4df25bc94ec2ac923d0c28e94b81fa9085e06d56dcfb229c7",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e多窗口。\u003c/strong\u003e在运行时创建、管理和关闭窗口，每个窗口都拥有自己的配置和生命周期。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Multiple windows.** Create, manage and close windows at runtime, each with its own configuration a…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0011-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "33ae19e5c1ec32e5edbde102d3980dfac9381281fb6629d47b2ed43d551b23be",
      "targetHash": "613bb9f622274e143d50f55aa661190feb843cf5bf19542bfbc149616a16b911",
      "machineHash": "613bb9f622274e143d50f55aa661190feb843cf5bf19542bfbc149616a16b911",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e系统托盘。\u003c/strong\u003e让应用常驻系统托盘，支持菜单、浅色和深色图标、macOS 模板图标，还可以将窗口附加到托盘图标。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**System tray.** Give your app a persistent presence, with menus, light and dark icons, template ico…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0012-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "1dc9ea3701e58e0a3a10bbdcb4567f02e6015e506a61299871432deb78408059",
      "targetHash": "811571d1b4b00246854e47fe0b389354f8fe8cf584dc4b0f62ca9d48dc4e1607",
      "machineHash": "811571d1b4b00246854e47fe0b389354f8fe8cf584dc4b0f62ca9d48dc4e1607",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e原生菜单和对话框。\u003c/strong\u003e在各个平台上提供应用菜单、上下文菜单和原生对话框。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Native menus and dialogs.** Application menus, context menus and native dialogs on each platform.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0013-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d2d61981cc51ec72e52b8e0173df79caf7d79fe33b90105a98011805bf0bdd95",
      "targetHash": "f5ee98a11423c03e6b29a32f7d55513b36563d06261adb64e6d0049a171fa481",
      "machineHash": "f5ee98a11423c03e6b29a32f7d55513b36563d06261adb64e6d0049a171fa481",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e服务和生成式绑定。\u003c/strong\u003e后端仍是普通的 Go 代码。绑定通过静态源代码分析生成，因此只需一条 `wails3 generate bindings` 命令，就能将注释和有意义的参数名称一并传递到前端。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Services and generated bindings.** Your backend stays ordinary Go code. Bindings are generated wit…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0014-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "accffbc36156893a0aa5d71d38a1f67c613e0a809928881486f8746aa270b0bc",
      "targetHash": "0dc066f6ea71fad79170147a2b1b15bf5a69ac222738f0e253194f7a75e2371c",
      "machineHash": "0dc066f6ea71fad79170147a2b1b15bf5a69ac222738f0e253194f7a75e2371c",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e清晰可见的构建系统。\u003c/strong\u003e项目使用基于 [Taskfile](https://taskfile.dev) 的构建系统，你可以检查、扩展和调试它，而不再依赖一条不透明的命令。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**A build system you can see.** Projects use a [Taskfile](https://taskfile.dev)-based build you can …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0015-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "5e59db608575129d7e0b7b032c0168cbc953125548895ec74eb9f6c0f2f301e8",
      "targetHash": "716101cee01002cc83f2661923c7da71fdbac6b83c810066f9fb124a6cade913",
      "machineHash": "716101cee01002cc83f2661923c7da71fdbac6b83c810066f9fb124a6cade913",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e跨平台。\u003c/strong\u003e支持 Windows（amd64 和 arm64）、macOS（Intel 和 Apple Silicon）以及 Linux（amd64 和 arm64）；Linux 默认使用 GTK4 和 WebKitGTK 6.0。在 v3.1 之前，仍可通过 `-tags gtk3` 使用旧版 GTK3 技术栈。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Cross-platform.** Windows (amd64 and arm64), macOS (Intel and Apple Silicon) and Linux (amd64 and …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0016-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a5baf7bbcbbc3c145b02e87c7b23170cc84e02524d020f4f0022052894b01c34",
      "targetHash": "f15b02a46bf6456fb8c848b54e84f2d7a31b855313428f291dceffc74764e0de",
      "machineHash": "f15b02a46bf6456fb8c848b54e84f2d7a31b855313428f291dceffc74764e0de",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003eiOS 和 Android。\u003c/strong\u003e同一套 `main.go` 和前端可以在移动设备上运行。文档仍将移动端支持标记为实验性功能，因此请将其视为可供探索和反馈的功能，而非稳定承诺。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**iOS and Android.** The same `main.go` and frontend can run on mobile. Mobile support is still mark…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0017-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "00ba7303562e6b03584a4733671bae83c0dc3582c4118068975b5645ad4c2daf",
      "targetHash": "d882208d14f2bc22659cd575593fcd7f4a8c354dbd9e066176cb782499779ee6",
      "machineHash": "d882208d14f2bc22659cd575593fcd7f4a8c354dbd9e066176cb782499779ee6",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e使用 Go 1.26 构建。\u003c/strong\u003ev3 模块使用 Go 1.26 构建。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Built with Go 1.26.** The v3 module builds with Go 1.26.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0018-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "bf28b13f285a3e7ab108ffe2a924ea9b2ac7b6fef3fc69dbf86cfabe70692ad1",
      "targetHash": "9bd3dc52a4e4145795949e8eee9ed06561809a3cc31a9168f31f6b4828b66bd4",
      "machineHash": "9bd3dc52a4e4145795949e8eee9ed06561809a3cc31a9168f31f6b4828b66bd4",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e应用内更新程序。\u003c/strong\u003e支持可插拔提供程序、加密验证、原子替换，以及可自定义主题或替换的默认 UI。请参阅[更新程序指南](/guides/updater/)。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**An in-app updater.** Pluggable providers, cryptographic verification, an atomic swap and a default…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0019-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "8bbe30375175c849266d330218a2adc5a60be58faf626e190aec4e0906f81041",
      "targetHash": "4b8437d4b8570f3673880b1c5537b4818cde748b945370c57af689716491da08",
      "machineHash": "4b8437d4b8570f3673880b1c5537b4818cde748b945370c57af689716491da08",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e打包和签名。\u003c/strong\u003e提供各个平台的[代码签名](/guides/build/signing/)、[安装程序](/guides/installers/)和[MSIX 打包](/guides/build/msix/)指南。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Packaging and signing.** Guides for [code signing](/guides/build/signing/) on every platform, [ins…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
    "b0020-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "ba2d187e9961b32e9cccd30d728ab9f4f8a7e52d8b3df7286a358a6dce51d0c3",
      "targetHash": "b84c9c34f8dc40d7a94281d0b1ba1aa63be8d291f3edd255f248de557a5f632c",
      "machineHash": "b84c9c34f8dc40d7a94281d0b1ba1aa63be8d291f3edd255f248de557a5f632c",
      "machineText": "\u003cstrong\u003e服务器构建。\u003c/strong\u003e无需原生窗口，即可将同一应用和服务作为 HTTP 服务器运行。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Server builds.** Run the same application and services as an HTTP server without a native window.",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
