      "machineHash": "2c87c29336b69e56fd8b46798b35be383a9914f25a38f7e132fabf2a11d9be7e",
      "machineText": "v3.0.0 之后，我们将推出带日期标签（如 `v3.1.0-nightly.20261026`）的**每夜预发布版**，同时发布**每周次版本**，例如 `v3.1.0` 和 `v3.2.0`。每夜版可以让你更早获得近期修复，而每周发布则会定期提供经过测试的更新。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "After v3.0.0, we’re moving to **nightly pre-releases** with dated tags such as `v3.1.0-nightly.20261…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
    },
