      "machineText": "如果发现可复现的错误，请附上 `wails3 doctor` 的输出和最小示例进行报告。如果想提议新增功能或更改公开行为，请创建一份 WEP（Wails Enhancement Proposal，Wails 增强提案）草稿 PR，而不是功能请求议题。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "If you find a reproducible bug, please report it with the output of `wails3 doctor` and a minimal ex…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
