      "machineHash": "df4c39c632cd88a3cc9090ae9ac16f537605876c0bce669218e82ec71a411910",
      "machineText": "首先，要特别感谢 Wails 维护者[Atterpac](https://github.com/atterpac)。他在开发工具、Linux 桌面集成和社区支持方面所做的工作，帮助 v3 走到了今天。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "First, a huge thank you to [Atterpac](https://github.com/atterpac), a Wails maintainer, for the deve…",
