      "machineHash": "5702b852f02658d6ea83e8e6ff0f4cbde5b646e4adfdc8acc302585f78b674d6",
      "machineText": "特别感谢[Fabio Massaioli (fbbdev)](https://github.com/fbbdev)打造了如此出色的静态源代码分析器和绑定生成器。它是 v3 得以运行的关键组成部分：普通的 Go 服务可以转化为 JavaScript 和 TypeScript API，并将类型和文档一并传递到前端。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Special thanks to [Fabio Massaioli (fbbdev)](https://github.com/fbbdev) for creating such an amazing…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
