      "targetHash": "7a9dae21e511d92931117861f2d0a550dd2993b564fdf0913ab09b56d337c268",
      "machineHash": "7a9dae21e511d92931117861f2d0a550dd2993b564fdf0913ab09b56d337c268",
      "machineText": "还要感谢[Travis McLane](https://github.com/tmclane)在早期开展的大量平台工作；感谢[Stffabi](https://github.com/stffabi)奠定了资源服务器和原生平台基础；感谢[Zach Botterman (popaprozac)](https://github.com/popaprozac)实现了通知、Dock 集成及其他桌面功能；感谢[Ian VanSchooten (IanVS)](https://github.com/IanVS)实现了类型化事件并改进了运行时；也感谢[Lyimmi](https://github.com/Lyimmi)在 Linux 方面所做的工作。这些贡献，以及所有帮助构建和完善它的人所做的工作，至今仍是 v3 的一部分。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Thank you also to [Travis McLane](https://github.com/tmclane) for his extensive early platform work;…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:45:14Z"
