      "machineHash": "a6c5fe6d08123b509f654045e66daeb86001e92080880c9eb32e5716dd8ef706",
      "machineText": "向在 Wails 漫长转型期间一路支持它的赞助者致以最衷心的感谢。你们的支持让我们有时间完善架构、工具、测试和文档，最终走到今天。还要特别感谢 JetBrains 和 ZSA，以及通过代码审查支持本项目的[CodeRabbit](https://www.coderabbit.ai/oss)。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "A very heartfelt thank you to the sponsors who have carried Wails through this long transition. Your…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
