      "machineText": "我真的为 v3 感到自豪。希望你使用它进行开发时，能像我们打造它时一样享受其中。试试它，构建些东西，然后告诉我们你的想法。欢迎到 [Discord](https://discord.gg/JDdSxwjhGf)、[GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions) 或[subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/) 上来打个招呼。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "I'm really proud of v3. I hope it gives you as much pleasure to build with as it has given us to mak…",
